---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { Reveal } from '../components/Reveal'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="关于"
  description="Comfy Studio 开源边界、安全原则与反馈渠道。"
>
  <section class="container-page max-w-2xl py-16 sm:py-20">
    <Reveal client:visible>
      <p class="eyebrow">关于</p>
      <h1 class="section-title mt-3">开源工具链</h1>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Comfy Studio 把本机 ComfyUI 封装为可远程使用的创作栈：FastAPI、Gateway、Studio。
      </p>
    </Reveal>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-medium text-text">安全边界</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>推理始终在本地 GPU；云端只做 HTTPS 入口与转发。</li>
          <li>不要将 ComfyUI 8188 暴露到公网。</li>
          <li>上游润色 Key 只留服务端；客户端不落盘明文密钥。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-medium text-text">反馈</h2>
        <p>
          问题与建议请提交到
          <a
            class="text-accent underline underline-offset-2"
            href="https://github.com/mokyarcher/Comfy-Studio/issues"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub Issues
          </a>
          。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-medium text-text">许可</h2>
        <p>以仓库根目录 LICENSE 为准（若尚未添加，则以仓库声明为准）。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
